### Note 2 — 이진 탐색 (Java)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "title": "이진 탐색(Binary Search) 구현",
  "content": "## 이진 탐색\n정렬된 배열에서 목표값을 O(log n)에 찾는 알고리즘이다.\n\n```java\npublic class BinarySearch {\n    public static int search(int[] arr, int target) {\n        int left = 0;\n        int right = arr.length - 1;\n        while (left <= right) {\n            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n            if (arr[mid] == target) return mid;\n            if (arr[mid] < target) left = mid + 1;\n            else right = mid - 1;\n        }\n        return -1;\n    }\n\n    public static int lowerBound(int[] arr, int target) {\n        int left = 0, right = arr.length;\n        while (left < right) {\n            int mid = (left + right) / 2;\n            if (arr[mid] < target) left = mid + 1;\n            else right = mid;\n        }\n        return left;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nmid 계산 시 `(left + right) / 2` 대신 `left + (right - left) / 2`를 사용해야 오버플로우를 방지한다."
}

