### Note 9 — 스택 구현 (Python)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "title": "스택(Stack) 직접 구현",
  "content": "## 스택\nLIFO 구조를 갖는 자료구조다.\n\n```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        self._items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        if self.isEmpty():\n            raise IndexError(\"pop from empty stack\")\n        return self._items.pop()\n\n    def peek(self):\n        if self.isEmpty():\n            raise IndexError(\"peek from empty stack\")\n        return self._items[-1]\n\n    def isEmpty(self):\n        return len(self._items) == 0\n\n    def size(self):\n        return len(self._items)\n```\n\n괄호 유효성 검사 예시:\n```python\ndef isValid(s):\n    stack = Stack()\n    pairs = {')': '(', '}': '{', ']': '['}\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in '({[':\n            stack.push(ch)\n        elif ch in pairs:\n            if stack.isEmpty() or stack.pop() != pairs[ch]:\n                return False\n    return stack.isEmpty()\n```"
}

